  "bio": "KB Tattoo, an apprentice tattoo artist based in Otaki, New Zealand at ATB Tattoo Studio, specializes in custom illustrative tattoos with a keen proficiency in black&gray and fineline styles. Clients seeking an artist who combines artistic skill with a high standard of cleanliness need look no further. KB's dedication to maintaining a sterile environment ensures that every client can have peace of mind about their tattoo experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Otaki, Wellington, New Zealand\n\nKB Tattoo \nCustom illustrative tattoo\nEST.2021\nAll styles welcome, bookings available \nTattoo Artist @atbtattoostudio\nOtaki, Kapiti Coast, Wellington",
